cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "AI-CTA: AI-Industrial Predictive Safety"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of a predictive safety framework for
  high-hazard industrial facilities. Combines Isolation Forest and
  LSTM-based anomaly detection with quantile-regression remaining
  useful life estimation, neural risk modelling, conformal threshold
  calibration, and three-component risk aggregation. Includes a
  streaming pipeline, REST API service, and reproducible benchmarks
  on the NASA C-MAPSS and CWRU datasets.
